}</style><div class="truncate-component js-truncate-component--abstract"><p class="ds2-5-body-md">This guide presents the Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe) 4.0, specifically designed for lean software and systems engineering. It outlines key components such as program epics, program Kanban, and Scrum methodologies, providing a structured approach for scaling agile practices in larger organizations while emphasizing collaboration, quality, and efficient time-to-market strategies.</p><div class="toggle-truncation-button js-toggle-truncation-button--abstract"><button class="safe-abstract--toggle-truncation-button"><span>... </span><span class="safe-abstract--toggle-truncation-button-text">Read more</span></button></div></div></div></div><div class="safe-sticky-ctas--container js-loswp-sticky-ctas hidden"><button class="ds2-5-button js-tc-loswp--continue-reading-button--sticky-ctas js-login-button--42b02f9d">See full PDF</button><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
